<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Alpargatas Q3 net $2.3 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Alpargatas Q3 net $2.3 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Net $2.3 million vs n/a</p>
<p>Revs $99.7 million vs $102.7 million</p>
<p>Nine months</p>
<p>Net $4.9 million vs n/a</p>
<p>NOTE: Alpargatas SAIC, textile and footwear maker, did not provide earnings per share.</p>
<p>At September 30, net worth stood at $357 million. The firm reported retained earnings of $4.9 million.</p>
<p>-- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom 541 318-0650</p>
</text>
